{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"交通資料對外 API","version":"1.0.0","description":"VD 車流報表 / 壅塞報表 / 串流清單。所有端點需帶 X-API-Key header。\n即時查詢用 /realtime（滾動視窗，每次查都是新數字）；要不重疊的固定統計區間用 /vd-report/latest。"},"servers":[{"url":"http://100.92.17.87:8000","description":"本機"}],"paths":{"/api/v1/external/realtime":{"get":{"tags":["External API"],"summary":"即時 VD 車流報表（mode=minute 分鐘內累積 / mode=window 滾動視窗）","description":"即時 VD 車流報表 —— 兩種取樣方式，記錄格式與 /vd-report 完全相同。\n\n**mode=minute（分鐘內累積）** — 起點釘在當前整分，終點是「現在」，跨分歸零。\n分鐘內任何時間查，拿到的都是「從整分到當下的累積」：\n\n    18:49:14  起點 18:49:00  經過 14 秒  累積  2\n    18:49:54  起點 18:49:00  經過 54 秒  累積 18   ← 同一起點，只增不減\n    18:50:15  起點 18:50:00  經過 15 秒  累積  6   ← 跨分歸零\n\n分鐘結束時的累積值，等於 /vd-report 該分鐘桶的值（已實測，含大車 0 不符）。\n統計單位是一分鐘、又想在分鐘內看到進度時用這個。\n\n**mode=window（滾動視窗，預設）** — 每次往回看 window_sec 秒，起點終點一起移動。\n適合畫面顯示，數字較平滑。⚠️ 視窗互相重疊，直接加總會重複計算，不可拿來存檔。\n\n共通：\n- 資料直接讀原始表、不經聚合，沒有聚合延遲。\n- `elapsed_sec` 是本次涵蓋的秒數；`flow_per_hour` 依它換算成每小時車流率。\n- `in_flow` / `out_flow` **只有畫了進出線的攝影機才有這兩個欄位**（不是給 0）。\n- `status`：active = 正常運作，disabled = 該攝影機停用（數值恆 0，不是沒有車）。\n- 沒測速的攝影機 `avg_speed_kmh` 為 null（不是 0 —— 0 代表車速真的是 0）。\n\n要存檔請改用 /vd-report/latest：那是不重疊的固定分鐘桶，一分鐘只有一個答案。","operationId":"external_realtime_api_v1_external_realtime_get","security":[{"APIKeyHeader":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"mode","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(window|minute)$","description":"window=往回推 window_sec 秒的滾動視窗;minute=從當前整分累積到現在(跨分歸零)","default":"window","title":"Mode"},"description":"window=往回推 window_sec 秒的滾動視窗;minute=從當前整分累積到現在(跨分歸零)"},{"name":"window_sec","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":600,"minimum":10,"description":"滾動視窗長度(mode=window 時有效)","default":60,"title":"Window Sec"},"description":"滾動視窗長度(mode=window 時有效)"},{"name":"detector_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"攝影機 camera_id;留空=全部","title":"Detector Id"},"description":"攝影機 camera_id;留空=全部"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/external/vd-report":{"get":{"tags":["External API"],"summary":"VD 車流報表 — 指定時間區間","operationId":"external_vd_report_api_v1_external_vd_report_get","security":[{"APIKeyHeader":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"start_time","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"起始時間 ISO8601,例 2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00。不帶時區視為 UTC;查台北時間請帶 +08:00","title":"Start Time"},"description":"起始時間 ISO8601,例 2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00。不帶時區視為 UTC;查台北時間請帶 +08:00"},{"name":"end_time","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"結束時間 ISO8601,例 2026-07-13T23:59:59+08:00。格式同 start_time","title":"End Time"},"description":"結束時間 ISO8601,例 2026-07-13T23:59:59+08:00。格式同 start_time"},{"name":"detector_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"攝影機 camera_id(2/3/6/8,見 /streams);留空=全部","title":"Detector Id"},"description":"攝影機 camera_id(2/3/6/8,見 /streams);留空=全部"},{"name":"interval","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"時間桶大小:1m / 5m / 1h","default":"5m","title":"Interval"},"description":"時間桶大小:1m / 5m / 1h"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"輸出格式:json / csv","default":"json","title":"Format"},"description":"輸出格式:json / csv"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/external/vd-report/latest":{"get":{"tags":["External API"],"summary":"VD 車流報表(快捷) — 最近 N 分鐘 + 統計摘要","description":"快捷查詢:免自己算時間/UTC,自動回最近 N 個「已結束」的桶 + 統計摘要。\n上層每分鐘輪詢就打這個(建議 minutes 給 3~5 容